id: class-up-hero
name: Hero
order: 1
optionOf: class-up-class-selection
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Dodge Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
text: >
  Hero [Passive]: Increase your Dodge Rolls and Soak Value by 1(T).
  • Hero [1/Encounter]: Use the Power Up Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver. If you do, gain an additional stack of Power from this use of the Power Up Maneuver.

---

[passive, effect 2]
dodge += 1(T);
soakValue += 1(T);

# (3) Its Choice effect - an Instant once an Encounter, its own Maneuver (maneuvers/).
[passive, effect 3]
allow maneuver.class-up-hero-choice;
